NC Digital offers fully managed starter websites for small businesses across Wales — from Cardiff and Swansea in the south to Wrexham and Bangor in the north. A complete website package built, hosted, and managed for you from **£20 per month inc. VAT**.

## A professional Welsh business website without the hassle

Our Managed Starter Website service is designed for Welsh small businesses that want a professional online presence — without the upfront cost of a custom build or the ongoing burden of managing it themselves.

Every plan includes a professionally built website, your own custom domain, fast UK hosting with SSL, daily backups, and ongoing technical management. We also add new pages every month, building your Google visibility over time.

## Plans from £20/month inc. VAT

- **Starter — £20/month inc. VAT** — 5 new pages added per month
- **Growth — £35/month inc. VAT** — 10 new pages added per month
- **Scale — £50/month inc. VAT** — unlimited new pages added per month

See our [managed starter websites service](/services/managed-starter-websites/) for full plan details. For businesses that need a fully bespoke design, our [web design Wales](/web-design-wales/) and web development Wales services are the better fit.

## Areas we cover across Wales

- **South Wales** — [Cardiff](/managed-starter-websites-cardiff/), [Swansea](/managed-starter-websites-swansea/), [Newport](/managed-starter-websites-newport/), [Merthyr Tydfil](/managed-starter-websites-merthyr-tydfil/), [Bridgend](/managed-starter-websites-bridgend/), [Caerphilly](/managed-starter-websites-caerphilly/), [Pontypridd](/managed-starter-websites-pontypridd/), [Llanelli](/managed-starter-websites-llanelli/), and more — see [managed websites South Wales](/managed-starter-websites-south-wales/)
- **North Wales** — [Wrexham](/managed-starter-websites-wrexham/) and across [North Wales](/managed-starter-websites-north-wales/)
- **Mid Wales** — Aberystwyth, Newtown, Welshpool, and across [Mid Wales](/managed-starter-websites-mid-wales/)

## Frequently asked questions

**Where are you based?**

Merthyr Tydfil, South Wales. We work with businesses across Wales and the UK.

**Is there a contract?**

There's a minimum 6-month term, then rolling monthly with 30 days' notice.

